{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/970990-magical-prosthetics","id":970990,"title":"Magical prosthetics","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-16T17:08:06-07:00","id":970990,"title":"Magical prosthetics","content":"What would be the combination of Spheres, skills, and dice rolls needed to create and attach a magical prosthetic limb? Could this limb be used as a focus/yantra or have some kind of tool inside it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T17:35:36-07:00","id":971015,"title":"","content":"Isn't there some left handed legacy that does this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T18:15:30-07:00","id":971042,"title":"","content":"The Austere are a Left-Handed Legacy that replace body parts with machinery and strive to have a more mechanical outlook in how they 'fix' the universe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T18:56:23-07:00","id":971074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/970990-magical-prosthetics#post970990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What would be the combination of Spheres, skills, and dice rolls needed to create and attach a magical prosthetic limb? Could this limb be used as a focus/yantra or have some kind of tool inside it?</div> </div> </div> </div>The arcana would depend on what you make the prosthetic out of, whether it can be used as a Yantra depends on what the prosthetic is made out of (Like Silver for Acanthus). It probably requires Patterning or Making. Skills, no requirements necessary. Can it hold a tool inside it? Depends on the arcana it's made out of and if your ST requires that to be Reach or dice pentalies, etc. Dice roll would probably just be the same as casting any spell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T18:57:13-07:00","id":971659,"title":"","content":"Great, so the one option I apparently have is yet another group of &quot;technology is eeeeeeeeevil&quot; straw transhumanists. <br /> <br /> I was asking in terms of what arcana you'd need to make one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T19:33:05-07:00","id":971676,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I was answering that you could use any number of arcana to make one. Can't help it if you don't know how to take that answer and extrapolate some creative solutions. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Like, dead easiest? Just use Matter, but there's nothing stopping you from using Forces to create a limb of pure telekinetic energy, or making dead or ephemeral limbs serve with Death, etc.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">\u200bIn other words:</span></span></span><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/970990-magical-prosthetics?p=971074#post971074\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The arcana would depend on what you make the prosthetic out of, whether it can be used as a Yantra depends on what the prosthetic is made out of (Like Silver for Acanthus). It probably requires Patterning or Making. Skills, no requirements necessary. Can it hold a tool inside it? Depends on the arcana it's made out of and if your ST requires that to be Reach or dice pentalies, etc. Dice roll would probably just be the same as casting any spell.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T19:34:02-07:00","id":971677,"title":"","content":"Edit: Oh, I remember you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 09-17-2016, 10:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T19:36:30-07:00","id":971678,"title":"","content":"Now for the Austere that were mentioned earlier. It's the philosophy of the legacy that's the problem, not the fact that they're tranhumanists. Hell, their transhumanism is just a byproduct of their philosophy. I mean, there's a legacy literally called the Transhumanists and no one thinks its Left-Handed. Granted, mechanically I think it's a shit legacy, but poor mechanics doesn't mean someone was saying transhumanism was bad, just means they're bad at mechanics. <br /> <br /> So if it's all the same to you, let's not start the whinging again please. Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T19:37:44-07:00","id":971680,"title":"","content":"So, if I got it right:<br /> Spells = No Attainments = Duration and Dispellable<br /> Matter 4, Life 4: Merge existing limb and give it organic properties (two spells or one combinded)<br /> Matter 5, Life 5: Create merged mecha- limb with organic properties (one spell)<br /> <br /> By the same concept (instead of Matter) one can have<br /> Ephemeral Limb (Death/Spirit; touch or akward situations with Ghosts/Spirits),<br /> Platonic Limb (Prime; wtf is that? 8-again when you use your limb?)<br /> Goetic Limb (Mind; &quot;My thoughts are with your heart&quot; or &quot;My heart is with your thougts&quot;)<br /> etc...<br /> <br /> A really nice concept would be Artifact transpants like this <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b>(Sith-Artifact-Implanted Hazen, Star Wars, Knights of the Old Republic Comic)</b><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://vignette4.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/b/b6/SWKOTOR33.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> Basically, they would work as normal prosthetics (as above for spells)(or as mortal ones for more gore) with the exception that they hold powers and automatic triggered spells (most commonly directly applied to touched owner)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6169-shadowjim12","name":"Shadowjim12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T19:54:14-07:00","id":971689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/970990-magical-prosthetics?p=971659#post971659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Great, so the one option I apparently have is yet another group of &quot;technology is eeeeeeeeevil&quot; straw transhumanists.<br /> <br /> I was asking in terms of what arcana you'd need to make one.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I kind of like the Austere. I think their philosophy makes a little bit sense from the Guardian viewpoint, sure they're extremists, but they fight for what they think is a good cause.<br /> <br /> I don't in any way \u007f<i>agree</i> with their methods or their means, but I think they're pretty cool and way more than just &quot;straw transhumanists&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T20:00:48-07:00","id":971693,"title":"","content":"To be perfectly honest, I forgot about the Transhuman Engineers when I posted that. <br /> <br /> Though my problem with the Austere isn't that they're weird, is that they don't seem to have been intended as playable, and I'm all for options that make player mages feel genuinely monstrous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T20:30:02-07:00","id":971718,"title":"","content":"Well, you'd be wrong, they're playable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}